[00:00.00] 作词 : Waters/Roger
[00:00.00][by:SamDeGe]
[00:00.00] 作曲 : Waters/Richard/Roger/Wright
[00:04.12]
[01:29.99]Us and Them
[01:29.99]我们，和他们
[01:45.09]And after all we're only ordinary men
[01:45.09]都终归只是普通人
[02:03.76]Me, and you
[02:03.76]我，和你
[02:18.65]God only knows it's not what we would choose to do
[02:18.65]只有上帝知道这并非我们所愿
[02:37.36]"Forward!" he cried from the rear
[02:37.36]“前进！”他从后方喊道
[02:41.88]and the front rank died
[02:41.88]而最前一排的士兵倒下
[02:50.26]And the General sat, and the lines on the map
[02:50.26]将军坐在帐中，让地图上的线
[02:56.64]moved from side to side
[02:56.64]从一侧向另一侧移动
[03:00.97]
[03:03.40]Black and Blue
[03:03.40]黑，和蓝
[03:17.79]And who knows which is which and who is who
[03:17.79]谁知道哪个是哪个，谁是谁呢？
[03:36.76]Up and Down
[03:36.76]向上，和向下
[03:51.47]And in the end it's only round and round and round
[03:51.47]最终它只是原地打转
[04:09.78]"Haven't you heard it's a battle of words"
[04:09.78]“你没听说吗？这是一场言语的战争”
[04:15.42]the poster bearer cried
[04:15.42]卖报人喊道
[04:22.47]"Listen son," said the man with the gun
[04:22.47]“听着，小子”，持枪的人说道
[04:28.38]"There's room for you inside"
[04:28.38]里面有给你的地方
[04:32.66]
[06:06.68]Down and Out
[06:06.68]沉沦，或被逐出
[06:21.10]It can't be helped but there's a lot of it about
[06:21.10]这都无法被改变，但是其中大有深意
[06:39.72]With, without
[06:39.72]其中，其外
[06:54.06]And who'll deny that's what the fightings all about
[06:54.06]又有谁会否认这是所有奋斗的目标
[07:12.82]"Get out of the way, it's a busy day
[07:12.82]“给我让道，我今天忙着呢”
[07:17.89]And I've got things on my mind"
[07:17.89]“我脑子里有很多事情”
[07:24.60]For want of the price of tea and a slice
[07:24.60]仅仅想要一点点茶和面包
[07:30.74]The old man died
[07:30.74]老人最终还是死去了
